post.description:
Example requests :

1) Minimal request

```
{
  "productId": 1,
  "format": "Shapefile"
}
```

2) Request with Geographical crop (SelectionEntity)

```
{
  "productId": 1,
  "format": "Shapefile",
  "geographicalCrop": {
    "selectionEntityCode": "Provincie",
    "selectionEntityCodeValue": ["10000"],
  }
}
```

3) Request with Geographical crop (Polygon)

```
{
  "productId": 1454,
  "format": "Shapefile",
  "geographicalCrop": {
    "polygon": {
        "coordinates": [[187085.4939025,201638.5090496],[186000.8878598,191395.0075346],[171599.7298475,200312.8794418],[187085.4939025,201638.5090496]]
     }
  }
}
```


4) Request a predefined file

```
{
  "productId":4450,
  "format":"GML",
  "fileIds": ["4450/Landbouwgebruikspercelen_LV_2018_GewVLA_GML.zip"]
}
```

5) Request with Temporal crop

```
{
  "productId":1454,
  "format":"Shapefile",
  "TemporalCrop" : {
     "from" : "2022-01-01T00:00:00",
     "to" : "2022-01-30T00:00:00"
   }
}
```

6) Request a specific version of a product

```
{
  "productId":9753,
  "format":"Shapefile",
  "datasetVersionIds" : [ "1493346a-25b3-40db-b5c7-00b4a7336146" ] 
}
```

fileIds.description:
If this order is for predefined files, This is a list of the file id's to order.
To obtain the proper id's for a product, look at Files property of product detail /v2/Products/{id}
If ordering predefined files, leave GeographicalCrop and TemporalCrop empty
